Package: dssatutils
Type: Package
Title: Shared Weather and Soil Download Utilities for DSSAT
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Alwin", "Hopf", email = "alwinhopf@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Alwin Hopf
Maintainer: Alwin Hopf <alwinhopf@gmail.com>
Description: Reusable functions that download weather and soil data from a range of
    public sources (Daymet, GridMET, NASA POWER, Open-Meteo, AgERA5, NASA
    POWER + CHIRPS v2/v3, DWD station data, E-OBS European grids, BR-DWGD/Xavier Brazil
    grids, CMFD China grids, CHELSA-W5E5, AgMERRA, AgCFSR, SILO, PRISM, MSWX,
    MSWEP, CRU-JRA, TerraClimate, APHRODITE Asia, ANUSPLIN Canada, TAMSAT Africa,
    GHCN-Daily stations, Princeton PGF, MERRA-2; SSURGO, gNATSGO, iSDAsoil Africa,
    LUCAS Europe topsoil, SoilGrids, SoilGrids 2.0 online, POLARIS, FAO HWSD2,
    AgMIP/Han global DSSAT soil profiles, HiHydroSoil, SLGA, WISE30sec, WoSIS,
    GSDE, China BNU, FEBR/Embrapa Brazil, Soil Landscapes of Canada, European
    Soil Database, OpenLandMap)
    and write them as DSSAT .WTH and .SOL files for spatial / gridded crop-model
    runs.
    Shared by the DSSAT Gridded Run Tutorial and DSSAT ML Phenology Prediction
    projects so the download logic lives in one versioned place.
